      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huron%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The historic Lake Shore and Michigan Southern Railway, now owned by Norfolk Southern, still runs through Huron carrying freight and Amtrak trains.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
